    "interpretation": [
      "At c9 the new score chooses a nearer view from identical initial state. Both replies are positive, but the retained diameter is 1125.07m versus 32.11m. Candidate uses 11 clears versus one certified clear; its c9 non-scan cost still saves 11.80s, so the first divergence alone does not explain the total regression.",
      "At c13 the polygon/positive/negative ledger, current position and tuned channel match again. The new score rejects the previously useful active view and immediately executes 31 optical clears. Baseline later combines an active positive and shared positive before clearance. Their c13 non-scan cost difference is +133.11s.",
      "Subsequent route and discovery points differ, including c10 first discovery. Candidate c10 receives one active negative and then executes 20 optical clears after 72 of 108 points are pruned. Its non-scan cost difference is +235.25s. The stored hypothetical negative forecast matches the forecast after the actual negative, so this is not evidence that the negative branch remained omitted.",
      "All 59 added failed clears occur in c9/c13/c10 (10/30/19). This is action-cost accounting and a trace-supported sequence, not a controlled decomposition of causal effects."
    ]
  },
  "conclusions": [
    "The full ten-pair result is +0.713662% time saving, five faster and five slower; both variants clear all 115 sources with saved audits passing.",
    "Movement saving is offset by more failed clears. Active positive views fall, while negative views fall only slightly; the improvement is small and heterogeneous.",
    "The largest favorable case saves more than the entire net saving. Symmetric leave-one-pair-out results expose sensitivity; they do not replace or selectively redefine the original ten-pair score.",
    "Conditional pruning costs and worst-branch aggregation changed together. No ablation isolates their individual causal contribution. The evidence supports separating these changes in a future controlled study, not promoting this bundled candidate now."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Saved audit status is quoted; this diagnostic does not rerun geometric audits or a solver.",
    "Per-channel non-scan costs include actual movement and fees allocated to that channel; comparisons are not independent treatment effects.",
    "Finite working probabilities and positive-feedback scenarios do not establish calibrated probabilities or continuous worst-case performance.",
    "Only the frozen hashed field and ten local independent layouts were evaluated; no official generalization or optimality claim."
  ]
